ent-CMUM2CDoorGunDropship = M2C heavy machine gun

ent-CMUDropshipAttachmentDoorGunUTESC = UTES-C Door Gunner Hardpoint System
    .desc = A box that deploys a crew-served UTES-C heavy machine gun. Fits on gunship hardpoint attachment points.

ent-CMUUTESCDoorGunDropship = UTES-C heavy machine gun
    .desc = A crew-served UTES-C heavy machine gun mounted on a gunship door-gunner hardpoint.

ent-CMUDropshipAttachmentDoorGunGAU19M = GAU-19/M Door Gunner Hardpoint System
    .desc = A box that deploys a crew-served GAU-19/M minigun. Fits on gunship hardpoint attachment points.

ent-CMUGAU19MDoorGunDropship = GAU-19/M mounted minigun
    .desc = A crew-served GAU-19/M minigun mounted on a gunship door-gunner hardpoint. Uses GAU-19/H 9mm drums and requires no battery pack.

ent-CMUMinigunGAU19MDropshipLoaded = GAU-19/M mounted minigun
    .desc = The minigun fitted to a GAU-19/M door-gunner hardpoint.

ent-CMUMagazineMinigunGAU19M = GAU-19/M drum magazine (9mm)

ent-CMUCrateMagazineGAU19M = GAU-19/M drum magazine crate (x1)

ent-CMUDoorGunBarrelLight = door gun barrel light

ent-CMUVisorGunshipCrew = Basic gunship crew HUD
    .desc = A helmet-mounted display linking a door gunner to their gunship's ammunition, hull integrity, and system warnings.

ent-CMUVisorGunshipCrewAdvanced = Advanced Gunship crew HUD
    .desc = An aircrew helmet display combining gunship status, medical overlays, and toggleable protection against firing into its own gunship. Requires Aircrew training.

ent-CMUActionGunshipCrewIFF = Toggle Gunship IFF
    .desc = Toggle the advanced crew HUD's interlock against firing a door gun into its own gunship.

ent-CMUActionMountedIFF = Toggle Door Gun IFF
    .desc = Toggle the door gun's interlock against firing when its predicted shot would hit a friendly IFF target.

